WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:07.890
“CANCER”.... doesn’t the term scare
us all?

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:10.600
Well it surely does!

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.299
But how does this
bizarre disorder grip our lives?

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:18.410
How is it able to conquer over our mind, body
and

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:20.070
soul?

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.869
Why is it so scary?

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:26.220
Let us find the answers in this video!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:31.000
We will start by understanding what exactly
cancer is.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.860
We all know that the cells in our body continuously
divide.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:40.920
Cell Division occurs for
various reasons ranging from growth and development

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.190
to repair.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:45.629
However, the process happens in an orderly
manner.

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:50.609
Now if the cells lose control
over their division process, then the uncontrolled

00:00:50.609 --> 00:00:55.079
division can lead to formation
of lumps of outrageous cells.

00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.649
This is nothing but Cancer!

00:00:58.649 --> 00:01:03.640
In simple words, Cancer is a disorder which
develops when the cells in our body

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:08.130
grow out of control, creating a cell mass.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.910
This mass of cells known as tumor.

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:15.840
Now tell me, is every tumor growing in the
body always cancerous?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.440
Many of us
would yes….

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.670
But the answer is a No!

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.240
Every tumor is not cancerous.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.540
A tumor is a mass or lump of cells.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.310
So depending
upon whether it is capable of invading other

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:35.810
tissues and cause harm, or it can
silently remain at one place without harming

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:42.130
other cells in the vicinity, a tumor is
classified in two major types.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.990
One type is called malignant and the other
type is

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.700
called benign.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.620
Let’s understand each type one by one.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:56.960
Sometimes, a few cells lose their ability
of controlled division and form a tumor.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.490
But after a particular time, the tumor does
not grow much in size and remains

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.750
calm at its place.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:06.420
It does not spread across the blood to invade
surrounding

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.869
tissues.

00:02:08.869 --> 00:02:13.610
These calm, harmless and non-cancerous tumors
are called Benign

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:14.939
tumors.

00:02:14.939 --> 00:02:18.780
On the other hand, malignant tumors are cancerous.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.769
They spread and invade
other body tissues.

00:02:21.769 --> 00:02:25.739
Here, their aggressive nature helps the tumor
cells to derive

00:02:25.739 --> 00:02:29.349
nutrients from other surrounding healthy cells.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:34.430
As a result, the healthy cells die
and this gives the tumor cells an opportunity

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.269
to grow even faster!

00:02:36.269 --> 00:02:41.580
The process of spreading of the cancer cells
to other body parts, and then growing

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:45.489
continuously in those locations is known as
metastasis.

00:02:45.489 --> 00:02:51.560
Now that we have learned about the types of
tumors, let’s move ahead and learn

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.359
about the types of cancer.

00:02:54.359 --> 00:02:55.819
Are there types of cancers?

00:02:55.819 --> 00:02:58.159
Yes there are!

00:02:58.159 --> 00:03:01.121
Among the
several types of cancers studied today, we

00:03:01.121 --> 00:03:04.900
will mainly focus on three major types.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:12.280
On our list we have carcinomas, sarcomas,
leukemias and lymphomas.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:14.349
Let us glance at these types.

00:03:14.349 --> 00:03:18.319
Carcinomas are cancers of epithelial tissues.

00:03:18.319 --> 00:03:22.930
That means, carcinomas are
developed in the skin and tissue lining of

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:28.760
the organs like prostate, breast, colon,
pancreas, lungs and so on.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.609
The next type is that of Sarcomas.

00:03:32.609 --> 00:03:34.989
These types arise in the connective tissues
like

00:03:34.989 --> 00:03:39.579
bone cells, cartilage, muscles and other soft
tissues in the body.

00:03:39.579 --> 00:03:44.459
Now talking about Lymphomas and Leukemias,
aren&amp;#39;t the names self-

00:03:44.459 --> 00:03:45.889
explanatory?

00:03:45.889 --> 00:03:50.560
Lymphomas, as the name suggests, are the cancers
that develop in

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:54.870
the lymphocytes, which are a type of white
blood cells.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:58.489
On the other hand,
cancers which result in an abnormal amount

00:03:58.489 --> 00:04:04.260
of blood cells like abnormal number
of red blood cells, or leukocytes are known

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.260
as leukemias.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:12.049
So both, lymphocytes
and leukemias are types of blood cancers!

00:04:12.049 --> 00:04:14.430
And how is any of these types detected?

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:19.690
There are several techniques developed today,
all thanks to the modern science

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.830
and technology.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:26.310
For diagnosis various tests are performed
on the patients.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:31.120
Imaging techniques like
x-ray, computer tomography, magnetic resonance

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.770
imaging, PET CT scan and many
more are performed.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:39.910
These imaging techniques give the medical
examiner an idea

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:45.639
of the size, shape and location of a particular
tumor or multiple tumors inside the

00:04:45.639 --> 00:04:47.150
body.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:53.410
Similarly, Blood tests can be done to find
out the different types of blood cancers.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.890
Biopsies of the tissues are also done for
better diagnosis.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:02.289
That is, a small sample
of tissue or the tumor to be precise, is removed

00:05:02.289 --> 00:05:06.870
from the patient&amp;#39;s body to
determine the nature of cancer.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:13.039
Oncologists, that is medical practitioners
dealing with cancers, believe that early

00:05:13.039 --> 00:05:18.460
diagnosis of any type of cancer gives a better
chance of curing the case and this

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.650
increases the survival rate in cancer patients.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:27.639
The most common treatments for cancer include
surgery, chemotherapy and

00:05:27.639 --> 00:05:29.949
radiotherapy.

00:05:29.949 --> 00:05:33.599
Surgeries are performed to remove the tumor
from the body.

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:37.070
In chemotherapy
various drugs which inhibit the growth of

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:40.210
growing cells in the body are used.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:44.639
Since these drugs kill the growing cells,
all the aggressively growing cancer cells

00:05:44.639 --> 00:05:47.370
get killed with different doses.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:54.830
Lastly, radiotherapy focuses on destroying
tumor cells using different radiations.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:06:00.880
High doses of radiation are used to kill or
shrink tumor cells.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:04.810
Apart from these, there are various other
techniques which are being developed

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.770
and are under trial stages in clinical testing.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:14.330
A healthy lifestyle, and avoiding exposure
to harmful chemicals and radiation are

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:19.080
a few steps to keep our body cells from getting
damaged, and turn aggressive!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:25.240
Also, regular health checkups which can help
in early detection of any type of

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.000
tumor, can increase the chances of curing
the patient!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:34.039
This was about one of the most dangerous disorders
that the human race is

00:06:34.039 --> 00:06:36.189
fighting today!

00:06:36.189 --> 00:06:42.080
To know about more interesting concepts, do
subscribe to our channel!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.340
Happy learning!!

